  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-09T03:58:24.369Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "as useful as having a toon shader is for quest, 2 features on the poiyomi shader would help us creators immensely. rim lighting but most importantly outlines. the current only way to add outlines to an avatar in Quest is to double your polygon count in creating an inverse double hull. this would also help cut down on texture sizes as outlines can create crisp details without the need for high def texturing",
